    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the way you put that about him being \"carried by the weight\" is... kind of haunting. it feels really real. but i don't know how to move him forward. if i keep him just suffering in this loop, it feels dishonest to the character. like, what's the point of him just enduring it if there's no actual resolution? it's just more of the same emptiness.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
